#","source_tag":"_t","target":"这里有一段铭文：\n#{italic}#……羽毛在风中轻盈飘飞。\n树根深深扎下……#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a74372dba53b12213956ba1267bd89ac938e1fab7a752f615b14a0d6d1b32f53","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c21352c40e466f26071bc6bc4f51cca8a4f15e6b24a3947d27c34f10a9dddb","logical_entry_identity":"bbd52af879777e39903c76b01cba84468478b0a2f71354dc1b9e514b38431e18","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"bow","source_tag":"_t","target":"弓"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9d976e4f9546958c5ce6605614407570a5cd3c23ce2199b8f6d037c678579f0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c266955ca070e0cd544b73af5a10d7170e10e587f957b2d6df033211ecbf2b","logical_entry_identity":"971df9ce1bc00cbfa03c61776f741b07f5aa245806bbf5c772bf82a32d9fcce7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A small rock that seems from beyond this world, vibrating with a fierce energy.  It feels warped and terrible and evil... and yet oh so powerful.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这块小石头看起来不是这个世界的，它不时产生着激烈的能量震动，让人感到扭曲、可怕、邪恶……而又强大的能量。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ffb30087bed0ce4580e83e4f0108c15d70ab61bfd2101befec852d2336ebaa9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c28dfe4b229c487cb9355e47e3224844982641696c505731b152bd7c773b7f","logical_entry_identity":"5db92d05d3c61e662796dd379bce169556c34446c4def900f43085b91b471a1c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Use energy to move yourself and others.","source_tag":"_t","target":"使用能量来移动你自己和他人。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"42b854f95359bdb2abcdc628047942b7e3bfa037a743aba9a03e7c99fa13509a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c331b42f51ef327106fe4207518d58966f8a70d902c7d0b29489140a78002d","logical_entry_identity":"7a0faba2cc8ca2e76b24de65d0b8a8ef2d7eacf64dfb140544d9e8791cf13f13","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"There seems to be a total of four of them. The more you have the weaker the shield will be.","source_tag":"_t","target":"似乎一共有四个水晶球，你得到的越多，护盾的防御力越弱。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99506354b85e9ee782bf80bd74c95caf2f824477e17e751877dcb556442c2999","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c474a6da7a33f8890e03cb27b4d455ce41d3bb1d7d6a2361b020147edcfc08","logical_entry_identity":"181310f87a059258c8780d39bbf7a58f6720c04f5732d14872e5dc7f6a1205a3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A paper scrap containing some lore.","source_tag":"_t","target":"包含了一些手札的纸片。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1e0db4b00fb9652de3753b299b7c93f44713ca529ee388effd8526a5fe1caa7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c568560c98e2e60373d0adf17c8cc802a1574173789f8de0af82aeae6f0a34","logical_entry_identity":"c12847ba9f04d8e7b9416f043a2f0be2a92a86ce263a1f35b0b7dcb5ffc9f31a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"and devoured alongside a Sun Paladin","source_tag":"_t","target":"并和那位太阳骑士一起葬身蛛腹"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b1f671cf7df87d308de74eafcffdef1696516b3465efe88a2c696de1355686d7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1c9d406c0f5d22cafb0cde0d4c484f5475714c7f2e278aff78bd41d1f33048d","logical_entry_identity":"dec47bdd0e96216c62e409ebd6b7d3f567194d56fcde18122881ef2e665e9e30","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* You have explored the Heart of the Gloom and slain the Dreaming One.#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#* 你已经探索了黑暗之心并杀死了沉梦者。#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b3526edad2a476132531232740545acdbdbfe7a89dcb726ba7b2d9208961a27c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1cc18dd08a9aa3917c2c6fa940f31b1b4cdd705f38dee2bccfb13852de959b7","logical_entry_identity":"726090c493f3820da3fb51e31b80274807bec79ed8fb65ad4d562a182a9269b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"rough leather cap","source_tag":"entity name","target":"粗制皮帽"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"43f1335bdb2da4ffe1b31bbb4d487588dcbe96e455be70b5d5cbc63bca33df93","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1cd6fb504f3f8c421bbdb98148886f74982d2a5c9d5460e47e768a5388dc529","logical_entry_identity":"8d677346691b9b015a1584345cca4af3e7634e428fbf994736ae952ef175a2dc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dear Rolf,\n\nI hope this letter finds you well. I must apologise for this recent dry spell in our communication; my adventures across Maj'Eyal have taken many exciting and perilous turns as of late. What turns do I speak of, you ask? I know how you delight in reading the accounts of my exploits, so I shall waste no further time on this pre-amble.\n\nImagine, if you will, a wolf. Imagine a beastly wolf, a wolf with strength, ferocity and a lust for flesh matching that of an entire pack of its lesser kind. You too may have some small experience with these \"wargs\" as the locals are wont to call them. Now... imagine one the size of a bear. Truly, as I travelled the lands surrounding Derth did I come across such a monstrous, awe-inspiring, lupine adversary. With fangs of a length to match my own blade, I entered combat against this lupine lord and its skulking brood. To my regret I failed in slaying the beast, but I assure you - simply surviving against such feral rage is an honour worthy of recognition and renown.\n\nAnd indeed, would there have been much glory in killing such a creature? True, I would have had enough to fur to line each and every boot and hat in Derth, but legends must live on. They are what give this world its very spirit!\n\nWith eager anticipation for your reply,\nWeisman","source_tag":"_t","target":"亲爱的罗尔夫，\n\n我希望这封信可以安全的到达你手。我必须为我们最近这段时间疏于联系道歉：最近，我在马基·埃亚尔各地的冒险经历又有了许多惊险刺激的转折。你问我说的是什么转折？我知道你很喜欢阅读我的冒险事迹，所以客套话我就不多说了。\n\n想像一下，一只庞大如熊的饿狼，赤眼如炙，饥渴的吞噬着它周围一切的生命。这只暴君所带来的威胁远超一整群它弱小的同类。你也许亦曾对付一些当地人口中所谓的座狼，但想象一下这只如同熊一般巨大的“好家伙”。事实上，当我在周围的旅行时，不巧就遭遇到了这样一只令人生畏的贪婪怪物，它挥舞的獠牙比我的剑还要长。于是我与这只座狼王和它的狼子狼孙们展开了激烈的搏斗。可惜的是我最终并没有杀死这只野兽，但我能自豪的说，能从这场战斗中存活就已经是值得称道的了。\n\n再说，杀死这样的生物又能有多大荣耀呢？对，我确实会得到一大堆狼毛，多到足以给德斯镇每双靴子和每顶帽子做毛皮衬里，但我的内心告诉自己这种传说中的生物必须让其繁衍下去。因为正是它们，赋予了这个世界真正的灵魂！\n\n殷切的期盼着你的回信，\n威斯曼"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0eace9798d44b58345cbdb52deb9052c4068b6bb23132ea6a66261fb9853b7e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1dab1da51e8e2411055e8d3a2d7123a909571d693bcba72d7f0e7c1e32cd59e","logical_entry_identity":"e939ebc4d107bccfcde762f3dd2cf0db55b1f4c6918ebfdf0aa2602848b9ab7e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is infected by a disease, reducing its dexterity by %d and doing %0.2f blight damage per turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被感染疾病，降低 %d 敏捷并每回合受到 %0.2f 枯萎伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5348b8d0295c583aac2a5ef7aa9d70aec95e9c6938ef920c85a338b487946e99","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1e2c6116ff7cdc12d8a2eebd81aa657b7afb0ad07cb3e015b4ace04a28ba76f","logical_entry_identity":"27af9405f8ec9d795e1e412979592066d2bd14b69bd8692118690eb648d65de7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dirt","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"土路"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"75f68cd423515b2afa817a792808da395f4ee0ee9b4cb69aa0be3b05f25f0a21","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1e36872f7bb1482ce9e3ddace9c71b6054c49135f02b41a4d3ab68299320d63","logical_entry_identity":"9c23c0d195d8ccc552d4b20937a3edb73164c08023d5624f9ec7363c2feb3100","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%s resists the dazing blows!","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"%s抵抗了眩晕打击！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"405d296237e187b6bf07adcff10257d426112e9fd10acd00359babef1515456f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1e4b92efd19dae00175554384d9bff84759e7a5d00d0fee96b2d256ae7a9b03","logical_entry_identity":"42c2a612d01d0aaf30cc27ad29413e195266f0f679f70148003313e935d7f032","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Yiilkgur raising toward the sky","source_tag":"_t","target":"伊克格，飞向天空"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"957c100b5eca09fce5abf64b976e63298e82782d1696ac44be4a96d5a3e09086","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1e945bacc2f0d55ef2424bbcd899356d29ae70b19e8a4d3e547474aeb81591e","logical_entry_identity":"842d374296d3ef22599a1066216086124ed8cb8e2f625188eb71261230ad97ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source# cleaves through #Target#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#劈中了#Target#！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cf8e445c1d453bc705c0b41d10af0a107e543411850db22116b3df4fe07a2a1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1ea15712f5f3f3c680e146e15950b6ac86194a0db9345ebc3f6a5ca7185579d","logical_entry_identity":"6db5cdca80765524c9bd59ebb9994af62649443de256c8a85b4708687b10fccd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sorcerers? I have never heard of them. There were rumours about a new master of the Pride, but it seems they have two.\nThank you for everything. You must continue your hunt now that you know what to look for.","source_tag":"_t","target":"法师？我从来没听说过他们。传说部落有了一个新的领袖，看样子现在应该有两个。\n感谢你所做的一切。既然你已经知道要找的是什么，就必须继续你的追猎。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"85679071ffad70de79a1872c5531dd87df50d03ee68c7da5a4cb3ccd31fab584","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1ebd1bef4c6538e144e98682d6ea690ce8e51a1674f3c1d00ad2d754b21b69a","logical_entry_identity":"972ae29734214977795c4561a44acd83588544873e6279814d1def6f39550ccf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"sandworm tooth","source_tag":"ingredient name","target":"沙虫之牙"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"474b26bc8a63e746fd10ebcd0d1191e0954108013a2f4cd9449c5f2dd4e6d606","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1f4ff3ec672ff3cc117898c45e93af331f0f81c64b404905199575f9bc745ea","logical_entry_identity":"0d6c1d5fb727acac538bef3157fdcd4786fdc2faa183a5199b670fe658d14ea8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Melee Retaliation: ","source_tag":"_t","target":"近战反伤："},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ec52b364ef11ac747b5107b8aaaf612b97034f403d37677739613c0a8da79778","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e1fa5b82b330626dc4ef19b567788ec5ddddb04bcf10b882fc69c2370a3cdb2b","logical_entry_identity":"260b84a24d81f78bb363bad8e414b60891bdb92ae95daecb7c6d07d1e8da564e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*You can feel the man smiling from inside his hood*#WHITE#\nThe Arena is where the brave come to fight against all odds.\nWe are still growing up, and we lack challengers...\nIt's like a gamble, but you use your fighting instead of money to play, you see?\nWe in the Arena work hard to make a good show, and in return...you can get enough\nwealth and glory to last for centuries!\nIf you can pass my little test...I will #LIGHT_RED#allow you to join the Arena when\nyou are done with your adventures.#WHITE#\nYou also shall gather some much needed #LIGHT_RED#combat experience#WHITE# from fighting\nour men...so, what do you think? Are you up to it?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你能感觉到兜帽下的男人露出了微笑*#WHITE#\n竞技场是勇者迎战重重险境的地方。\n我们仍在发展，正缺少挑战者……\n这就像一场赌博，只不过你下注的不是金钱，而是自己的战斗本领，明白吗？\n我们竞技场竭力奉上精彩表演；作为回报……你能赢得享用几个世纪也用不完的财富与荣耀！\n如果你能通过我的小小考验……等你的冒险结束后，我会#LIGHT_RED#准许你加入竞技场。#WHITE#\n与我的手下交战，还能让你获得急需的#LIGHT_RED#战斗经验#WHITE#……\n怎么样？你能胜任吗？\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6d03eaa9376164a8a0e3cb916784d71446b2082ec0fef7e98f9ed369204e4b02","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e200845e1abc8076051b8f755bd28ff1bfe68ebb7009b6c15f1b022aaecd461a","logical_entry_identity":"5199ea29cbb18d6b524aa1d034fbd2b4ba3e3f42221a9900d178f9f0d74695ca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your battle cry shatters the will of your foes within a radius of %d, lowering their Defense by %d for 7 turns, making them easier to hit.\n\t\tAll evasion and concealment bonuses are also disabled.\n\t\tThe chance to hit increases with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的怒喝会减少 %d 码半径范围内敌人的意志，减少它们 %d 闪避，持续 7 回合。\n\t\t同时，躲闪效果和不可见带来的闪避效果会被取消。\n\t\t命中率受物理强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7b677297aa55466f12bff277b1b0398a7bce4f364325ca5d4ad4a1cfdb8ba658","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e2099e73f44dc50fa20ce7cd839a58e4b6ce02a628f8a120a4c4ff6be93c7c63","logical_entry_identity":"7d8541cc260b5f6c34ba88a7e1255143a682071f7588324d8fcaf1cbbdb062ee","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This very thin sword cuts through the air with ease, allowing remarkably quick movement.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这柄超乎寻常的薄刃能轻松地在空气中挥舞，让你行动更为迅速。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c8e6e606adbec2b1eb95a8e7a9c5f3f321598fac816149fd01e3220998ae17e1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e20b7f07ac3417e61fe7f76d3ee16a6d26364772d0fb026588e53d7b44d77ed6","logical_entry_identity":"dbfebb80ff81dd3a679d64a69d3d36456b56627b33363ba7e34cac2dc53416ed","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sorry, I have to go!","source_tag":"chat_gates-of-morning-main","target":"抱歉，我要走了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2935fc97eb3681171fdeabe64fef4efa1a0c0cceb362f8f43c33820b66bd6225","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"e20d0bc1f7544cdd5c4b1cb06f1e9b290ff96c65eeb5699173b22dcd3f5486e3","logical_entry_identity":"e50fe9db63df388c0813c48e5a827539b98c02f99f5b8046e2ba822ca69d581f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"gold","source_tag":"entity short_name","target":"金质"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"bf27c7e7d839cafa0a15d65b7933c68e80287e87c3b833fb14755fde1d767140"}